  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-04-20T15:46:53.979Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "A recent and reoccurring thing now is that there are many people on VRChat under the ages of 13. To help separate them from adults/NSFW activity from the kids I was thinking that when people create an account if they put they are under the age of 16 (Since thats the age of consent) then they will see a filtered side of VRChat. Meaning if they go into a world it will be a world with other people who are under the age of 16. The current worlds wont be restricted to them it's just that there will be a filter that separates the age range. I know more of the older people hang out in PC worlds to avoid kids on quest. But there are quest users that actually are mature and old enough and it would be nice to meet others of the same age.",
